Architecture
```
The engine follows a modular architecture:

1. Core Engine - Main evaluation logic
2. Rule Models - Data structures for rules and conditions
3. Evaluator - Rule evaluation and execution
4. DSL - Domain-specific language for policy definition
5. Adapters - Input/output adapters for different formats
6. API Layer - REST and CLI interfaces

